Get Info <p>Returns a Json with a list of available voices, as well as the character limit allowed for synthesis.  </p> <ul> <li>Endpoint: <code>POST /api/getinfo</code> </li> <li>Request Body: none  </li> <li>Response example:     <pre><code>{
    "maxCharacters": -1, 
    // -1 means no character limit
    "voices": [
        {
            "entry": "eng-AUS-ExampleVoice", 
            // voice entry id, used when requesting synthesis as a parameter.
            "formattedName": "🇦🇺 ♀ Example Voice", 
            // formatted name to use when listing voices.
            "sampleText": "This is an example of speech synthesis in Australian English." 
            // sample text, usually each voice has a personalized sample.
        },
        {
            "entry": "eng-GBR-ExampleVoice2",
            "formattedName": "🇬🇧 ♂ Example Voice 2",
            "sampleText": "This is an example of speech synthesis in British English."
        }
    ]
}
</code></pre></li> </ul> Get Cooldown <p>Returns a Json with the cooldown value in milliseconds.  </p> <ul> <li>Endpoint: <code>POST /api/getcooldown</code></li> <li>Resquest Body: none</li> <li>Response example: <pre><code>{
    "cooldown": 5000
}
</code></pre></li> </ul> Synthesize Audio <p>Generates an audio file from text using specific voice and speech parameters, returns a binary audio stream.  </p> <ul> <li>Endpoint: <code>POST /api/synthesize</code></li> <li>Request Body: <code>application/json</code><ul> <li><code>entry</code> (string): The voice entry identifier.</li> <li><code>textToBeSpoken</code> (string): The source text to synthesize.</li> <li><code>speechRate</code>, <code>speechPitch</code>, <code>speechVolume</code> (integer): Audio modulation parameters.</li> <li><code>punctuationPause</code> (integer): Enum for pause length (0 = Normal, 1 = Short, 2 = Very Short).</li> <li><code>format</code> (integer): Enum for output file format (0 = <code>.wav</code>, 1 = <code>.ogg</code>, 2 = <code>.aac</code>).</li> </ul> </li> <li>Response:  <ul> <li><code>200 OK</code> - Returns a binary audio stream.</li> <li><code>401 Unauthorized</code> - Request too soon, user still on cooldown.</li> <li><code>500 Internal Server Error</code> - Something went wrong while requesting sythesis from engine.</li> </ul> </li> </ul>
